    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mc Peake Auctioneers are thrilled to bring 20 Brindley Park Road to the market.\r\nThis is a fabulous 2 bed mid terrace spanning a generous 71 Sqm, Located in a small horseshoe cul del sac.\r\nIdeally located within walking distance to numerous bus stops and Ashbourne town centre, local school campus, GAA grounds, this property is bright and airy with well-appointed accommodation.\r\nThe kitchen/ diner is situated to the rear of the property, it comes fully fitted with all appliances including a brand new Fridge freezer, there’s is also a utility off providing loads of extra storage.    The rear garden is west facing and is sun drenched, and is bursting with stunning flowers shrubs and has a spacious paved area, providing an ideal place to relax.\r\n On the first floor there are two great sized bedrooms with the main bedroom ensuite, and a separate main bathroom.\r\n20 Brindley park Road would be a perfect starter home and will also be ideal for someone downsizing.\r\nTo arrange a viewing contact Mc Peake Auctioneers"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Walking distance to Ashbourne Village \r\nGFCH\r\nRecently freshly painted throughout\r\nWell -appointed accommodation\r\nNew fridge Freezer\r\nWest facing rear garden"
      },
